{"name":"Hammarn","size":"large","type":"demon","tag":"","alignment":"Evil","hitDice":"10","armorName":"none","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"10","speed":"40","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"60 (10d10 + 10)","speedDesc":"8m","strPoints":"9","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"9","intPoints":"12","wisPoints":"17","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"60","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"4","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Illumination","desc":"The [MON] sheds bright light in a 50-meter radius and dim light in an additional 100m."},{"name":"Aggressive","desc":"As a bonus action, the [MON] can move up to its speed toward a hostile creature that it can see."}],"actions":[{"name":"Fire Battleaxe","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit:_ [WIS 1D8] fire damage, or [WIS 1D10] fire damage if used with two hands."},{"name":"Fire Bolt","desc":"_Melee Spell Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, reach 36m, one target. _Hit:_ You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes [WIS 1D10] fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell ignites if it isn’t being worn or carried."},{"name":"Life Drain","desc":"_Melee Spell Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, reach 5m, one creature. _Hit:_ [WIS 2D6] fire damage. The target must succeed on a DC 12 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This reduction lasts until the creature finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0."},{"name":"Hell's Born","desc":"_Ranged Spell Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, range 0/10m, all target. _Hit:_ You raise a pillar of fire around you, striking all creatures and objects within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the targets. On a hit, the target takes [WIS 3D6] fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell ignites if it isn’t being worn or carried."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"dex","order":1},{"name":"wis","order":4}],"skills":[{"name":"arcana","stat":"int"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[{"name":"Acqua (x5)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"Fire (x-1)","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"conditions":[{"name":"deafened"},{"name":"exhaustion"},{"name":"poisoned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Infernal","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"hammarn","pluralName":"hammarn","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}